OL,3,GNEWSAJudge extends car park boarding-up
OL,4,Aorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has ruled Leicester's landmark
OL,7,FLee Circle car park should remain
OL,8,Fboarded up for a further two months.
OL,10,FThe disused multi-storey building was
OL,11,Fsealed up in June in a bid to prevent
OL,12,Fcrime and disorder, including illegal
OL,13,Fcar meets, drug use and fire setting.
OL,15,FLeicester City Council applied for an
OL,16,Fexpiring three-month closure order to
OL,17,Fbe extended at a hearing at the city's
OL,18,Fmagistrates' court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
